window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v27-097-4e69826e6878f01f.json"]={sha256:"4e69826e6878f01f670dab9fbe5fa87373d24f6b972d4a3409c68366537f71e6",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-b9fc9baa8f876204","url":"https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/services/cisa-tabletop-exercise-packages","title":"CISA Cybersecurity Tabletop Exercise Tips","titleEn":"CISA Cybersecurity Tabletop Exercise Tips","publisher":"CISA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-097","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-097","related":[{"id":"security-v27-098","referenceUrls":["https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/61/r3/final"],"title":"NIST SP 800-61r3：決策證據新鮮度與重新評估觸發","titleEn":"NIST SP 800-61r3: evidence freshness and decision reassessment triggers","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付branch-matrix.csv、inject-cards.json、decision-evidence.csv與facilitator-notes.md，分開出席、已演練與成功三種指標。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver branch-matrix.csv, inject-cards.json, decision-evidence.csv and facilitator-notes.md. Report attendance, exercised coverage and successful outcomes as three distinct measures with their own denominators.","difference":"為每個決策依據保存observed_at、適用範圍、來源與本地政策有效期；在固定決策時間判定新鮮、過期或未知，並保留歷史。","differenceEn":"Record observed_at, scope, source and a locally defined lifetime for each decision input. At a fixed decision time, classify evidence as fresh, stale or unknown while preserving its history.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["CISA CTEP提供可調整的目標、情境與討論材料；本課8格矩陣是自行設計的覆蓋模型，不代表CISA認證或完整風險集合。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 三個二元因素共2×2×2=8格；第一輪有4個不同組合留下決策證據，另重複其中一格3次，不算新增覆蓋。 不同組合覆蓋4/8=50%，不是7/8；重複次數可測熟練或一致性，但不等於探索新決策路徑。","NIST SP 800-61r3把事件回應納入風險管理；本課有效期是合成組織政策，並非NIST要求的分鐘數，也不把新鮮等同真實。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 決策時間60分鐘，五份依據的觀測時間為55、40、30、50、未知；各自有效期10、15、30、5、10分鐘，邊界age≤TTL算新鮮。 年齡5、20、30、10、未知，第一與第三新鮮、第二與第四過期、第五未知；新鮮比例2/5=40%。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["CISA CTEP provides customizable objectives, scenarios and discussion materials. The eight-cell matrix is an original coverage model, not a CISA certification or an exhaustive inventory of operational risks. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. Three binary factors produce 2×2×2=8 cells. The first round documents decisions for four distinct combinations; three additional repeats of one existing combination add no new branch coverage. Distinct-combination coverage is 4/8=50%, not 7/8. Repetition can assess consistency or practice, but it does not explore a previously untested decision branch.","NIST SP 800-61r3 integrates incident response with risk management. Evidence lifetimes here are synthetic organizational policy, not NIST-prescribed minute values, and freshness alone does not establish truth. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. Decision time is minute sixty. Five inputs were observed at 55,40,30,50 and unknown, with respective lifetimes 10,15,30,5,10 minutes. Define freshness inclusively as age no greater than lifetime. Ages are five, twenty, thirty, ten and unknown. The first and third are fresh, second and fourth stale, fifth unknown, giving a fresh-input fraction of 2/5=40%.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v27-007","referenceUrls":["https://docs.github.com/en/actions/reference/security/oidc"],"title":"GitHub OIDC：部署環境與 reusable workflow 身分","titleEn":"GitHub OIDC: deployment environments and reusable workflow identity","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付branch-matrix.csv、inject-cards.json、decision-evidence.csv與facilitator-notes.md，分開出席、已演練與成功三種指標。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver branch-matrix.csv, inject-cards.json, decision-evidence.csv and facilitator-notes.md. Report attendance, exercised coverage and successful outcomes as three distinct measures with their own denominators.","difference":"製作12筆main、pull request、production environment與重用workflow的claim描述；畫出repo、environment、workflow reference各自由誰控制，不使用真實token。","differenceEn":"Prepare 12 claim descriptors spanning main, pull requests, production environment and a reusable workflow. Identify who controls repository, environment and workflow reference, using no live token.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["CISA CTEP提供可調整的目標、情境與討論材料；本課8格矩陣是自行設計的覆蓋模型，不代表CISA認證或完整風險集合。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 三個二元因素共2×2×2=8格；第一輪有4個不同組合留下決策證據，另重複其中一格3次，不算新增覆蓋。 不同組合覆蓋4/8=50%，不是7/8；重複次數可測熟練或一致性，但不等於探索新決策路徑。","雲端信任條件必須與實際subject樣板一致；environment不能被推論成分支仍在subject內。固定workflow版本與受眾條件分開檢查。 12筆中6筆符合repo與production環境；加入既定reusable workflow SHA要求後只有4筆符合；所有token描述皆採相同受眾。 環境條件覆蓋6/12×100=50%；完整workflow條件4/12×100=33.3333333%。沒有把PR事件自動當可信部署。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["CISA CTEP provides customizable objectives, scenarios and discussion materials. The eight-cell matrix is an original coverage model, not a CISA certification or an exhaustive inventory of operational risks. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. Three binary factors produce 2×2×2=8 cells. The first round documents decisions for four distinct combinations; three additional repeats of one existing combination add no new branch coverage. Distinct-combination coverage is 4/8=50%, not 7/8. Repetition can assess consistency or practice, but it does not explore a previously untested decision branch.","Cloud trust conditions must match the actual subject template. An environment context does not imply the branch remains encoded in the subject. Verify pinned workflow identity and audience independently. Six of 12 rows satisfy repository and production-environment conditions. Adding the approved reusable-workflow SHA requirement leaves four; all token descriptors share the same configured audience. The environment conditions admit 6/12×100=50%; the complete workflow conditions admit 4/12×100=33.3333333%. A pull-request event is never automatically treated as a trusted deployment.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-f53ed62dd159700c","url":"https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/61/r3/final","title":"NIST SP 800-61 Revision 3","titleEn":"NIST SP 800-61 Revision 3","publisher":"NIST","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-80fe11d8c90dc34c","url":"https://docs.github.com/en/actions/reference/security/oidc","title":"GitHub Actions OpenID Connect reference","titleEn":"GitHub Actions OpenID Connect reference","publisher":"GitHub","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
